-- 登记: D5-pjoi-beam | 语义: 把梁的起点写回 E 63 N 0 D 42.3
-- expected_net: cancelled | restore 搭档: 本文件是 joint/pjoi_beam_apply.mac 的 restore | 库: db8000
-- 写的是绝对值，重跑幂等。期望与 apply 对称：重建梁 S1 与主关节两件，主关节回到原来的原点。
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-PJOI-BEAM-RESTORE-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-A-F1-N1-J1
Q REF
Q NAME
Q POS WRT /*
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-A-F1-S1
Q REF
Q NAME
Q TYPE
Q POSS
Q POSE
POSS E 63 N 0 U -42.3
Q POSS
Q POSE
Q DRNS
Q DRNE
Q JOIS
Q JOIE
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-A-F1-N1-J1
Q CREF
Q DELP
Q POS WRT /*
Q ORI WRT /*
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-A-F1-N1
Q REF
Q NAME
Q NPOS
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite T2 joint/pjoi_beam restore: beam POSS -> N 0'
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-PJOI-BEAM-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
